["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.271 阿迪達斯如何觸底反彈？ Samba 可銷售月數 減計準備 破二\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-bizthisway-阿迪达斯触底反弹-炒冷饭比巨星联名更稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">28:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>阿迪達斯觸底反彈：炒冷飯比巨星聯名更穩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">阿迪達斯從2021年高點接近腰斬後，靠解凍復古鞋、修復經銷商和嚴格控庫存完成業績復甦，但股價反彈又回落，揭示運動品牌週期的本質是庫存與預期的博弈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">阿迪達斯</span><span class=\"tag\">運動品牌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Searching For A Co-Founder Is How You Get A Bad One | 4 VC-Backed Solo Founders leaky bucket smile curve SFP ODF\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-solofounders-找联合创始人这件事-越刻意越容易找错人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b9626cb5db9929c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>找聯合創始人這件事，越刻意越容易找錯人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把聯合創始人當成創業的前提條件，最後往往只能湊一個「便利聯合創始人」；四位單人創始人用親身經歷說明，先獨自跑起來，對的人會在路上出現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">聯合創始人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From Chrome DevTools to AI Engineering, with Addy Osmani cognitive surrender alpha unbundling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-pragmatic-ai-时代工程师的护城河是品味与问责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8706fd7ea4b30623-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的護城河是品味與問責</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chrome DevTools 負責人 Addy Osmani 認為，AI 讓寫代碼貶值，工程師的真正優勢是品味與問責；要警惕認知投降，把 AI 的答案當成自己的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Chrome DevTools</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#35 Lee Cronin - Chemputation, Origin of Life, Assembly Theory Chemputation Assembly Theory assembly index reproducible irreproducibility shallow explorers\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-coolworldslab-ai-不会抽象-所以你的工作不是检查代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c25bbc0316663e15-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CoolWorldsLab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不會抽象，所以你的工作不是檢查代碼</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cronin 說 AI 只是快速的淺層探索者：過去是離散的、可被機器學習，未來是連續的、原則上無法被機器學習，人類能憑空造出一個新空間再跳過去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 創造力</span><span class=\"tag\">生命起源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Alien Companion App That&#x27;s Bringing In $4M a Year (Best of the Pod) judge prompt lower seeds situations daemon\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-aiandi-ai-伴侣不做预设-记忆即角色-年入-400-万美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 伴侶年入 400 萬美元：不做預設劇情，靠記憶即興發揮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 伴侶 Portola 的 Tolon 拋棄預設劇情和角色表，用記憶當角色表、把生成當即興，做到年化收入 400 萬美元。這套「即興演員」方法論和混合模型策略，是 ChatGPT 之外的另一條產品路徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI伴侶</span><span class=\"tag\">即興敘事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"$4M in 4 Weeks: How This AI Alien Companion App Took Off (Best of the Pod) Big Five vibe prompting judge prompt character-driven computing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-every-4周破400万美元-ai伴侣的爆红与500ms陷阱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85a2a5e14cec9857-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI伴侶4周賺400萬美元：多500毫秒延遲就崩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外星伴侶 Tolen 四周內 ARR 從 1 萬美元飆到 400 萬美元，但多 500 毫秒延遲所有指標就暴跌。增長靠病毒視頻，留存靠把 AI 當敘事媒介而非工具。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI陪伴</span><span class=\"tag\">病毒增長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Dr. Suchi Saria on Building AI That Changes Care failure to rescue DRG NTAP AI-based interventional protocols\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-nejmaigrandrou-ai-进医院最难的从来不是模型-是让医院算得清账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">59:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 進醫院最難的從來不是模型，是讓醫院算得清賬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Suchi Saria 帶著 90% 醫生採用的膿毒症預警進入醫院後斷言：AI 的攔路虎不是模型性能，而是按病種付費制度下的信任與財務賬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療AI</span><span class=\"tag\">膿毒症預警</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Adam Weishaupt and the Bavarian Illuminati Illuminati Minerval Covenant of Perfectibility Astroturfing Principia Discordia Illuminatus! Trilogy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-stuffmissed-光照派从未统治世界-它连自己都管不好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>光照派死於內鬥：陰謀論是後來編的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">光照派是1776年教授與五名學生建立的反教會組織，巔峰約兩三千人；它死於內鬥和自戀，如今的陰謀論形象來自後來的書和惡作劇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">秘密結社</span><span class=\"tag\">陰謀論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Luke Burgis on Mimetic Desire, Catholicism, and the Age of Social Contagion mimetic desire scapegoat mechanism achievement subject sprezzatura via negativa memento mori\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-tyler-ai-削弱社会传染-反主流也是模仿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d05a7ce2e284a200-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>反主流也是模仿：AI 反而會削弱社會傳染</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在傳染時代，逃離不是解藥；Burges 押注 AI 反而會削弱社會傳染，並借天主教與 Cluny 的經驗提出：真正該做的是重建中間機構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模仿理論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 倫理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Whatnot Built a Global Marketplace live commerce rules engine EBITDA margin\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-a16z-直播电商在中国占三四成-美国还是个位数/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>直播電商在中國佔三四成，美國還是個位數</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Whatnot 從賣寶可夢卡起步，靠用戶自己在視頻裡賣貨長成 80 億美元年銷售額的平臺。中國直播電商已佔全部電商三四成，美國還是個位數——這個差距會關掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">直播電商</span><span class=\"tag\">marketplace</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"【重聽】朱雀三號副總師：火箭回收只有成與敗，沒有中間態| S9E41\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-whatsnext-入轨一分回收零分-火箭回收没有中间态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>入軌一分回收零分，火箭回收沒有中間態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱雀三號首飛入軌成功但回收失敗，副總師董凱認為火箭發射只有成敗沒有中間態：入軌打一分，回收打零分。真正決定追趕速度的是回收場射程、發動機冗餘和每年百臺的產能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商業航天</span><span class=\"tag\">火箭回收</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"North Korea&#x27;s Messiah Presbyterian YMCA Jonestown cult\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-chinatalk-朝鲜不是民族国家-是一个宗教社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3e77c5ae8dd56873-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>朝鮮不是民族國家，是一個宗教社會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金日成不是斯大林主義者，而是被19世紀美國福音派泡大的第三代基督徒；他偷聽到農民相信他能水上行走後，決定照著傳說演下去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">朝鮮</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"GPT-5.6 Sol Ultrafast.... Just Got UltraFaster (Cerebras 4th Gen) Wafer Scale Engine (WSE) Cross-reticle stitching Backpack Prefill/Decode Parametric yield\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-techtechpotato-推理速度才是新护城河-cerebras-机架化再提速/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fbc2fddc567e0b62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TechTechPotato</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>Cerebras 單芯片 4400 tok/s：推理速度才是護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cerebras 的 WSE 3.5 把單芯片速度推到 4400 tok/s，CS4 機架把三片晶圓塞進 120kW 機櫃。核心理由：推理要拆成 prefill 和 decode，速度才是護城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">Cerebras</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Canada&#x27;s controversial resettlement programme outport growth centre Confederation\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-witness-加拿大三万人大搬迁-最好的事与最糟的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">9:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大三萬人搬遷：年輕人得救，老人失去一切</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1954 年起，加拿大紐芬蘭近三萬人從偏遠漁村遷往城鎮。年輕一代獲得教育與出路，老人和因紐特人卻失去家園，失散到再無聯繫方式。搬遷沒有統一答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城鎮化</span><span class=\"tag\">移民安置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Clown Car W/ Gamersnexus ACR (Automated Content Recognition) SPV (Special Purpose Vehicle) Opex\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-betteroffline-ai-巨头财报像-enron-英伟达背书的算力泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨頭財報像 Enron：英偉達背書的算力泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 公司高管不再談技術，只談錢和吉瓦。英偉達用投資和擔保撐起客戶收入，像 Enron 一樣玩財務工程，但還沒到違法那一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"151. 17歲被2026年ICML收錄論文的小少年：我bet開心！開心！開心！ Attention Projection Mixing with Exogenous Anchors Value Residual Learning fineweb edu UBI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-19-zhangxiaojun-17岁ai原住民-学数学的理由-变成了向大学证明能吃苦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/510756c6bdaa8239-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>17歲AI原住民：學數學的理由，變成了向大學證明能吃苦</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 出現後，他學數學的理由退化成向大學證明自己能吃苦：原來能看到的大學、讀博、推進數學那條路變窄了，身邊想做航天的同學也在失去向上的動力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原住民</span><span class=\"tag\">AI與教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Do You Defend Against AI That Can Hack? guardrails honeypot script kiddies signature-based detection\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-a16z-ai-攻击面是全部人类表达-签名检测已死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">22:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>AI 攻擊面是全部人類表達，簽名檢測已死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全工具過去只防兩樣東西：人和惡意軟件。AI 智能體兩樣都不是，行為基線的前提——軟件行為可預測——已經失效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Make Better Decisions by Fixing Yourself First CGM Robux MCP Lua\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-knowledge-先修代谢再谈决策-roblox-创始人反常识管理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e77873607703d33-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>生酮逆轉兒子雙相後，Roblox 創始人把決策拆成四層</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Baszucki 把 Roblox 的決策操作系統拆成四層：身體代謝狀態決定重大判斷，長期視角乘以快速迭代，通用系統優於硬編碼，以及舊模式失效時直接換一整套新經濟系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">決策</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Child custody through divorce: Navigating the courts and building a custody schedule that works with Michael Fried OurFamilyWizard collaborative law parent coordinator change of circumstances forensic psychologist best interest of the child\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-secureattach-法院已默认五五开-赢家心态才是真正的输/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">52:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>離婚監護權：法院已默認五五開，贏家心態才是真輸家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">紐約離婚律師用十年趨勢告訴你：法院已從「證明單方監護」轉向「為什麼不是五五開」；真正決定孩子好壞的，不是時間表，而是父母能否把孩子需求放在自己的痛苦前面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">離婚</span><span class=\"tag\">兒童監護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"493 追憶歷史學家亞當·麥基翁：華人移民與現代邊境制度的形成 indentured labor Natal model 加拿大原則\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-cn2aa250-华人劳工塑造了美国海关-现代边控源自排华法案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>華人勞工塑造了美國海關：現代邊控源自排華法案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">海關、簽證與護照制度並非歐美內生的發明，而是19世紀末華人移民湧入美國後，為甄別與排斥而催生。合法移民艱難、非法移民容易的弔詭，到今天仍在延續。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麥基翁</span><span class=\"tag\">移民史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ben Thompson on Big Tech, China, and the AI Boom Running Out of Money - [Invest Like the Best, EP.487] reluctant accelerationist NeoCloud hyperscaler token efficiency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-ilt-美国赢下-ai-竞赛反而更危险-中国的最优解是炸掉-tsmc/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95cf973ef8d0bef7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>美國贏下 AI 競賽反而更危險：中國的最優解是炸掉 TSMC</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果美國在 AI 上取得壓倒性優勢，中國的博弈論最優解是炸掉 TSMC。硅谷不願承認美國對中國供應鏈的依賴被嚴重低估，而這種依賴不會在衝突之外被修復。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"285: ENCORE: How Do I Help My Kid Develop a Work Ethic? work ethic intrinsic vs extrinsic motivation warmth and structure complain but comply purpose nagging\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-asklisa-孩子不爱干活不用治-结构与后果比热爱更有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ace27132dfc1e3aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>孩子不愛幹活不用治：結構與後果比熱愛更有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">培養 work ethic 不靠讓孩子愛幹活，靠三件事：家庭結構有規則、特權與責任掛鉤、讓他感覺有人指望他；必要時讓他在學校自己摔一跤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The battle of Mandalay in WW2 Fort Dufferin 19th Indian Division Frontier Force Regiment 14th Army\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-18-witness-曼德勒战役胜负手-放弃正面突击改用围困/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>曼德勒戰役勝負手：放棄正面突擊改用圍困</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1945年3月英軍攻打緬甸曼德勒，面對Fort Dufferin的厚牆深壕，正面強攻失敗；師長拒絕硬攻，改為圍困，最終日軍棄城。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">緬甸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Sayyida al-Hurra, Moroccan Queen Sayyida al-Hurra Sharif Mulay Reconquista Privateer Morisco\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-17-stuffmissed-苏丹倒过来娶她-得土安女总督不是海盗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">36:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0817</span></div>\n<h2>蘇丹倒過來娶她：得土安女總督不是海盜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sayyida al-Hurra 統治得土安二十餘年，建立船塢、與奧斯曼私掠者合作對抗西葡；歐洲史料稱她海盜，近年論文視她為早期去殖民實踐的例子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">摩洛哥</span><span class=\"tag\">海盜與私掠</span>\n</div></div></a>"]